# Tolerances for a shifted cohesive zone model against the interface-fitted one. The surrogate and
# fitted interface faces sample the traction at different points, which changes the average and
# the maximum by up to about 1 percent. The minimum, at the clamped end of the interface, changes
# by up to about 4 percent. The floor only applies to the zero initial state.
GLOBAL VARIABLES relative 0 floor 0
    time relative 0 floor 0
    react_x relative 1e-2 floor 1e-6
    normal_traction_average relative 2e-2 floor 1e-6
    normal_traction_max relative 2e-2 floor 1e-6
    normal_traction_min relative 5e-2 floor 1e-6
